			"Message": "style(Rest): Normalise em-dashes to hyphens in README.md\n\nReplace typographic em-dashes (—) with ASCII hyphens (-) throughout the README to match the project's plain-text formatting conventions. Covers the blockquote, overview paragraphs, numbered feature items, Key Features section, table cell descriptions, Security table, and Related Documentation list.\n\nNo semantic content change — formatting consistency only.",
